{"4281480":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Mandala: Type To Defend","steam_appid":4281480,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TYPE FAST. CHOOSE YOUR TARGETS. DEFEND THE CORE.<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MANDALA: TYPE TO DEFEND<\/strong> is a fast-paced typing survival arcade game where every word is a target and every second counts.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies close in on a fragile core. Type their words to destroy them, intercept incoming projectiles, and keep the mandala alive.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But speed alone won't save you. <strong>Choosing what to type next matters just as much.<\/strong><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FOUR WAYS TO FIGHT<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your attack form and turn each completed word into something more powerful.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LANCE: Pierce enemies lined up behind your target.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ARC: Send attacks chaining between nearby threats.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOVA: Unleash explosive strikes against clustered enemies.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ORBIT: Store power and release it across multiple targets.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different weapons reward different decisions. Find the one that suits your typing style.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR OWN RITUAL<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your attacks evolve as you survive.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain strikes between enemies. Trigger explosive bursts. Push back approaching threats. Rebuild your shield when everything starts to fall apart.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine four upgrade families across multiple levels to shape your build during each run.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVERY WORD IS A DECISION<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-moving enemies close the distance. Ranged attackers fire projectiles you can intercept by typing. Dangerous threats force you to switch priorities before it's too late.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you finish the enemy you're attacking, stop the incoming shot, or eliminate the threat closest to your core?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep typing. Keep choosing. Stay alive.<\/strong><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FACE THE ECLIPSE<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive three escalating ritual phases:  Awakening, Fracture, and Convergence, before facing the Eclipse.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A final test of typing speed, battlefield awareness, and everything you've built along the way.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ONE MORE RITUAL<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Approximately 15-minute complete runs<\/strong> built for focused arcade sessions.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four attack forms<\/strong> with different combat behaviors.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four upgrade families<\/strong> to combine and develop.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distinct enemy behaviors<\/strong> and incoming projectiles to intercept.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combos, multipliers, and high scores<\/strong> that reward consistent typing.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No permanent power grind.<\/strong> Your decisions and skill determine how far you get.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your keyboard is your weapon. How long can you defend the core?<\/strong><\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TYPE FAST. CHOOSE YOUR TARGETS. DEFEND THE CORE.<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MANDALA: TYPE TO DEFEND<\/strong> is a fast-paced typing survival arcade game where every word is a target and every second counts.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies close in on a fragile core. Type their words to destroy them, intercept incoming projectiles, and keep the mandala alive.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But speed alone won't save you. <strong>Choosing what to type next matters just as much.<\/strong><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FOUR WAYS TO FIGHT<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your attack form and turn each completed word into something more powerful.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LANCE: Pierce enemies lined up behind your target.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ARC: Send attacks chaining between nearby threats.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOVA: Unleash explosive strikes against clustered enemies.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ORBIT: Store power and release it across multiple targets.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different weapons reward different decisions. Find the one that suits your typing style.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR OWN RITUAL<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your attacks evolve as you survive.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain strikes between enemies. Trigger explosive bursts. Push back approaching threats. Rebuild your shield when everything starts to fall apart.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine four upgrade families across multiple levels to shape your build during each run.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVERY WORD IS A DECISION<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-moving enemies close the distance. Ranged attackers fire projectiles you can intercept by typing. Dangerous threats force you to switch priorities before it's too late.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you finish the enemy you're attacking, stop the incoming shot, or eliminate the threat closest to your core?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep typing. Keep choosing. Stay alive.<\/strong><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FACE THE ECLIPSE<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive three escalating ritual phases:  Awakening, Fracture, and Convergence, before facing the Eclipse.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A final test of typing speed, battlefield awareness, and everything you've built along the way.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ONE MORE RITUAL<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Approximately 15-minute complete runs<\/strong> built for focused arcade sessions.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four attack forms<\/strong> with different combat behaviors.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four upgrade families<\/strong> to combine and develop.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distinct enemy behaviors<\/strong> and incoming projectiles to intercept.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combos, multipliers, and high scores<\/strong> that reward consistent typing.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No permanent power grind.<\/strong> Your decisions and skill determine how far you get.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your keyboard is your weapon. How long can you defend the core?<\/strong><\/p>","short_description":"Type to survive. Defend a glowing mandala against swarms, shooters, and incoming projectiles in a fast-paced typing arcade game. Choose from four attack forms, combine upgrades, unleash devastating chains, and fight through escalating waves.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4281480\/c30b961e4a20e05fe131e2c02ca7312db76af9d5\/header.jpg?t=1793729200","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4281480\/45a84d44b5544f36204e444cf527467ed4b08ae2\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793729200","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4281480\/45a84d44b5544f36204e444cf527467ed4b08ae2\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793729200","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Dual-core 2,0 GHz (Intel i3-2100 \/ AMD A6)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Intel HD 4000 \/ GeForce GT 710 (1 GB VRAM)<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Quad-core 3,0 GHz (Intel i5-4430 \/ Ryzen 3 1200)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> GeForce GTX 750 Ti \/ Radeon R7 260X (2 GB VRAM)<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"developers":["PAL-B"],"publishers":["PAL-B"],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":499,"final":449,"discount_percent":10,"initial_formatted":"$4.99","final_formatted":"$4.49"},"packages":[1497844],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Mandala: Type To Defend","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1497844,"percent_savings_text":"-10% ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"MANDALA: TYPE TO DEFEND - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$4.99<\/span> $4.49","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":449}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":68,"description":"Custom Volume Controls"},{"id":75,"description":"Keyboard Only Option"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"1","description":"Action"},{"id":"23","description":"Indie"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4281480\/b51ed677049c677f3c8e9fccf948ca29587f1477\/ss_b51ed677049c677f3c8e9fccf948ca29587f1477.600x338.jpg?t=1793729200","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4281480\/b51ed677049c677f3c8e9fccf948ca29587f1477\/ss_b51ed677049c677f3c8e9fccf948ca29587f1477.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793729200"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4281480\/6514e4f8d8b00943f7c5341ed83a49a5243df0d2\/ss_6514e4f8d8b00943f7c5341ed83a49a5243df0d2.600x338.jpg?t=1793729200","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4281480\/6514e4f8d8b00943f7c5341ed83a49a5243df0d2\/ss_6514e4f8d8b00943f7c5341ed83a49a5243df0d2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793729200"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4281480\/d34c702a9502ba04d95722841e12cab38d2406ec\/ss_d34c702a9502ba04d95722841e12cab38d2406ec.600x338.jpg?t=1793729200","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4281480\/d34c702a9502ba04d95722841e12cab38d2406ec\/ss_d34c702a9502ba04d95722841e12cab38d2406ec.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793729200"},{"id":3,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4281480\/9682955ab7495ce6297e1155722bac2a4214bb8d\/ss_9682955ab7495ce6297e1155722bac2a4214bb8d.600x338.jpg?t=1793729200","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4281480\/96